            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Not all async is pooled",
              "text": "Sockets use the OS poller; `dns.lookup` uses the pool."
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Phases in order?** timers, pending, idle/prepare, poll, check, close",
                "**Pool users?** fs, dns.lookup, crypto, zlib; not TCP/UDP",
                "**Poll, no timers due?** Waits for I/O, or moves to check if `setImmediate` is queued"
              ],
